# QLTS State Machine Diagrams

> Tổng hợp sơ đồ state machine cho toàn bộ các thành phần có trạng thái trong dự án QLTS.

---

## 1. Lead Phase Lifecycle (Phase Manager)

Nguồn: [phase_manager.py](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/services/phase_manager.py)

Phase được xác định từ `admission_profile.status`, **không phải** từ pipeline stage.

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> CONSULTATION : Chưa có hồ sơ
    CONSULTATION --> ADMISSION : Tạo AdmissionProfile
    ADMISSION --> FEE : Profile approved/confirmed/overridden
    FEE --> ENROLLED : Profile enrolled

    state CONSULTATION {
        note right of CONSULTATION
            Stages: stg01, stg02
            Statuses: sts00, sts02-06
        end note
    }
    state ADMISSION {
        note right of ADMISSION
            Stages: stg03, stg04
            Statuses: sts07-09, sts13, sts16-17
        end note
    }
    state FEE {
        note right of FEE
            Stage: stg05
            Statuses: sts10, sts14, sts18
        end note
    }
    state ENROLLED {
        note right of ENROLLED
            Stages: stg06, stg07
            Statuses: sts11, sts12
        end note
    }
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Universal Statuses** (`sts01`, `sts15`, `sts19`) có thể chọn ở **MỌI** phase và không thay đổi stage.

---

## 2. Admission Profile State Machine

Nguồn: [admission_state_machine.py](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/services/admission_state_machine.py)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT : Officer tạo hồ sơ

    DRAFT --> SUBMITTED : Officer submit

    SUBMITTED --> APPROVED : Manager approve
    SUBMITTED --> REJECTED : Manager reject

    REJECTED --> RESUBMITTED : Officer fix & resubmit
    REJECTED --> DRAFT : Officer revert to draft

    RESUBMITTED --> APPROVED : Manager approve
    RESUBMITTED --> REJECTED : Manager reject again

    APPROVED --> CONFIRMED : Lead xác nhận nhập học
    APPROVED --> OVERRIDDEN : Admin override

    OVERRIDDEN --> ENROLLED : Hệ thống tạo Student

    CONFIRMED --> ENROLLED : Hệ thống tạo Student

    ENROLLED --> [*]

    note right of ENROLLED
        FINAL STATE
        Tạo Student + StudentDocument
        Không cho phép chuyển tiếp
    end note
```

| Trạng thái | Chuyển tiếp hợp lệ | Ai thực hiện |
|---|---|---|
| `draft` | → `submitted` | Officer |
| `submitted` | → [approved](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/finance/refund.py#176-180), `rejected` | Manager |
| `rejected` | → `resubmitted`, `draft` | Officer |
| `resubmitted` | → [approved](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/finance/refund.py#176-180), `rejected` | Manager |
| [approved](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/finance/refund.py#176-180) | → `confirmed`, `overridden` | Lead / Admin |
| `confirmed` | → `enrolled` | System |
| `overridden` | → `enrolled` | System |
| `enrolled` | ∅ (terminal) | — |

---

## 3. Collaborator (CTV) Status

Nguồn: [collaborator.py](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/collaborator.py)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending : Đăng ký CTV mới

    pending --> active : Manager duyệt
    pending --> inactive : Manager từ chối

    active --> suspended : Vi phạm / tạm khóa
    active --> inactive : Chấm dứt hợp tác

    suspended --> active : Mở khóa
    suspended --> inactive : Chấm dứt

    inactive --> [*]
```

---

## 4. Lead Claim (CTV → Lead)

Nguồn: [collaborator.py#LeadClaim](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/collaborator.py#L129)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending : CTV submit claim

    pending --> approved : Staff duyệt → Tạo Lead + gắn referrer
    pending --> rejected : Staff từ chối

    approved --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]
```

> [!NOTE]
> Unique constraint: 1 CTV chỉ claim 1 lead 1 lần (`uq_claim_collaborator_lead`).

---

## 5. Commission Record

Nguồn: [commission.py](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/commission.py)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending : Trigger status đạt → Auto tạo

    pending --> approved : Manager duyệt
    pending --> rejected : Manager từ chối
    pending --> cancelled : Lead bị hủy / rollback

    approved --> paid : Kế toán xác nhận thanh toán
    approved --> cancelled : Hủy sau khi duyệt

    paid --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
```

| Trạng thái | Ý nghĩa |
|---|---|
| [pending](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/finance/refund.py#171-175) | Chờ Manager duyệt |
| [approved](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/finance/refund.py#176-180) | Đã duyệt, chờ thanh toán |
| [paid](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/finance/invoice.py#219-223) | Đã thanh toán cho CTV |
| `rejected` | Bị từ chối (có lý do) |
| `cancelled` | Bị hủy (lead rollback/status thay đổi) |

---

## 6. Fee (Học phí)

Nguồn: [fee.py](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/finance/fee.py)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending : Tạo Fee record

    pending --> calculated : Tính toán xong (base, discount, final)

    calculated --> invoiced : Tạo Invoice
    calculated --> waived : Admin miễn phí
    calculated --> cancelled : Hủy fee

    invoiced --> partial : Thanh toán 1 phần
    invoiced --> paid : Thanh toán đủ
    invoiced --> overdue : Quá hạn
    invoiced --> cancelled : Hủy fee

    partial --> paid : Thanh toán nốt phần còn lại
    partial --> overdue : Quá hạn

    overdue --> partial : Thanh toán 1 phần
    overdue --> paid : Thanh toán đủ

    paid --> [*]
    waived --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
```

---

## 7. Invoice (Hóa đơn)

Nguồn: [invoice.py](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/finance/invoice.py)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> draft : Tạo invoice

    draft --> issued : Phát hành cho sinh viên
    draft --> cancelled : Hủy trước khi phát hành

    issued --> partial : Thanh toán 1 phần
    issued --> paid : Thanh toán đủ
    issued --> overdue : Quá hạn
    issued --> cancelled : Hủy invoice

    partial --> paid : Thanh toán nốt
    partial --> overdue : Quá hạn

    overdue --> partial : Thanh toán 1 phần
    overdue --> paid : Thanh toán đủ
    overdue --> cancelled : Hủy

    paid --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
```

---

## 8. Payment (Thanh toán)

Nguồn: [payment.py](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/finance/payment.py)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending : Ghi nhận thanh toán thủ công
    [*] --> verified : Thanh toán online (auto-verify)

    pending --> verified : Checker xác nhận (maker ≠ checker)
    pending --> rejected : Checker từ chối

    verified --> refunded : Hoàn tiền

    verified --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]
    refunded --> [*]
```

> [!CAUTION]
> **Maker-Checker**: DB constraint `chk_payment_no_self_approval` ngăn `created_by_id = verified_by_id`.

---

## 9. Payment Intent (Thanh toán online)

Nguồn: [payment_intent.py](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/finance/payment_intent.py)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> created : Tạo intent + URL thanh toán

    created --> pending : User redirect tới gateway

    pending --> completed : Gateway callback thành công → Tạo Payment
    pending --> failed : Gateway báo lỗi
    pending --> expired : Hết hạn timeout
    pending --> cancelled : User/system hủy

    created --> expired : Hết hạn trước khi redirect

    completed --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    expired --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
```

---

## 10. Refund Request (Yêu cầu hoàn tiền)

Nguồn: [refund.py](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/finance/refund.py)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending : Officer tạo yêu cầu

    pending --> approved : Manager/Admin duyệt
    pending --> rejected : Manager/Admin từ chối

    approved --> refunded : Kế toán thực hiện hoàn tiền

    refunded --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]
```

---

## 11. Overpayment (Thừa tiền)

Nguồn: [overpayment.py](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/finance/overpayment.py)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending : Payment > Invoice amount

    pending --> applied : Chuyển sang invoice khác (apply_to_next)
    pending --> refunded : Hoàn tiền cho sinh viên (refund)
    pending --> cancelled : Xóa sổ / write_off

    applied --> [*]
    refunded --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
```

---

## 12. Lead Validity (Chất lượng Lead)

Nguồn: [lead.py#LeadValidityEnum](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/lead.py#L11)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> raw : Lead mới tạo

    raw --> valid : Staff xác nhận hợp lệ
    raw --> invalid : Thông tin sai
    raw --> duplicate : Trùng lặp

    valid --> qualified : Đạt tiêu chuẩn tư vấn

    qualified --> [*]
    invalid --> [*]
    duplicate --> [*]
```

---

## 13. Lead Assignment Status

Nguồn: [lead.py#assignment_status](file:///d:/QLTS/Backend_FastAPI/app/models/lead.py#L82)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending : Lead mới tạo / chưa phân công

    pending --> assigned : Auto-assign hoặc manual assign
    pending --> failed : Không tìm được officer phù hợp

    assigned --> reassign_pending : Manager yêu cầu chuyển

    reassign_pending --> assigned : Phân công lại thành công
    reassign_pending --> failed : Không tìm officer mới

    failed --> pending : Thử lại phân công
```

